    "body": "Hello @YeungKC,\r\n\r\nthanks for letting us know. We already have a couple of issues regarding asynchronous loading and git being slow.\r\n\r\nWe just did _Refactor modules to lazily execute commands_ in (#2111), which introduced a time out for executing external commands. As soon as _Replace the use of git2 with calls to the Git CLI_ (#1446) is implemented, we have  the time out for git as well.\r\n\r\nAnd in regards to asynchronous we still have #301.\r\n\r\nTherefore, I'm going to close this now. Please follow the other open issues.\r\n\r\nTake care\r\nMick",
